<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_italic ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">Evolving Language Models without Labels:
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Majority Drives Selection, Novelty Promotes Variation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yujun Zhou<sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup">†</sup>
</span><span id="id3" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_note ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Work done during Yujun’s Internship at Tencent AI Lab.</span></span></span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
