<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib36.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2505.21493</em>, 2025a.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib37" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou et al. (2024)</span>
